Using model: Claude Opus 4.6

╭────────────────────────────── Claude Opus 4.6 ───────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                              │
│  Let me search for more specific information about the SkyHotel pricing      │
│  model used in Vietnamese hotels.Now I have a clear understanding of         │
│  SkyHotel's pricing model. Key features: pricing by hour, overnight, daily;  │
│  surcharges for late checkout (by day/overnight); early check-in surcharges  │
│  (by day/overnight); surcharges can be fixed amount or percentage. Let me    │
│  search for more details about the pricing tiers/steps.Now I have a          │
│  comprehensive understanding of SkyHotel's pricing logic. Let me now build   │
│  the domain types for the pricing crate. Based on the information gathered:  │
│                                                                              │
│  SkyHotel Pricing Logic:                                                     │
│                                                                              │
│   1 Hourly Rate - tiered pricing by hour (bậc thang theo giờ)                │
│   2 Overnight Rate - flat rate for staying overnight (from e.g., 21h to 12h  │
│     next day)                                                                │
│   3 Daily Rate - per night/day rate                                          │
│   4 Monthly Rate - flat monthly rate                                         │
│   5 Surcharges:                                                              │
│      • Late checkout surcharge (for daily stays) - tiered by hours exceeded  │
│      • Late checkout surcharge (for overnight stays) - tiered by hours       │
│        exceeded                                                              │
│      • Early check-in surcharge (for daily stays) - tiered by hours          │
│        exceeded                                                              │
│      • Early check-in surcharge (for overnight stays) - tiered by hours      │
│        exceeded                                                              │
│      • Extra person surcharge - per person exceeding max occupancy           │
│                                                                              │
│  Here's the complete Rust implementation:                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  --------------------------------------------------------------------------  │
│                                                                              │
│  Implementation Code — src-tauri/crates/pricing/src/types.rs                 │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│   //! Domain types for CapyInn Pricing Engine VN                             │
│   //! Ported from SkyHotel pricing logic: hourly, overnight, daily,          │
│   monthly rates                                                              │
│   //! with surcharge steps for early check-in and late checkout.             │
│                                                                              │
│   use chrono::{NaiveDateTime, NaiveTime};                                    │
│   use rust_decimal::Decimal;                                                 │
│   use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};                                       │
│                                                                              │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│   // Enums                                                                   │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│   /// The billing mode that was selected (or auto-detected) for a stay.      │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]       │
│   #[serde(rename_all = "snake_case")]                                        │
│   pub enum BillingMode {                                                     │
│       Hourly,                                                                │
│       Overnight,                                                             │
│       Daily,                                                                 │
│       Monthly,                                                               │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   /// Whether a surcharge is a fixed amount (VND) or a percentage of base    │
│   rate.                                                                      │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]       │
│   #[serde(rename_all = "snake_case")]                                        │
│   pub enum SurchargeKind {                                                   │
│       /// Fixed amount in VND (e.g., 50_000)                                 │
│       Fixed,                                                                 │
│       /// Percentage of base rate (e.g., 25 means 25%)                       │
│       Percent,                                                               │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   /// Identifies the context in which a surcharge applies.                   │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]       │
│   #[serde(rename_all = "snake_case")]                                        │
│   pub enum SurchargeContext {                                                │
│       /// Late checkout surcharge for daily billing                          │
│       LateCheckoutDaily,                                                     │
│       /// Late checkout surcharge for overnight billing                      │
│       LateCheckoutOvernight,                                                 │
│       /// Early check-in surcharge for daily billing                         │
│       EarlyCheckinDaily,                                                     │
│       /// Early check-in surcharge for overnight billing                     │
│       EarlyCheckinOvernight,                                                 │
│       /// Extra person surcharge (per person per night/stay)                 │
│       ExtraPerson,                                                           │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│   // Surcharge Step (bậc thang phụ trội)                                     │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│   /// A single step in a surcharge tier table.                               │
│   ///                                                                        │
│   /// SkyHotel uses tiered surcharges: e.g., first 1h over = 30k, 2h over    │
│   = 50k, 3h+ = overnight rate.                                               │
│   /// Each step defines: from `from_minutes` to `to_minutes`, charge         │
│   `amount` (fixed or %).                                                     │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]             │
│   pub struct SurchargeStep {                                                 │
│       /// Inclusive lower bound in minutes (e.g., 0)                         │
│       pub from_minutes: u32,                                                 │
│       /// Exclusive upper bound in minutes (e.g., 60). Use `u32::MAX` or     │
│   `None` for open-ended.                                                     │
│       pub to_minutes: Option<u32>,                                           │
│       /// The surcharge kind: fixed VND or percentage of base rate           │
│       pub kind: SurchargeKind,                                               │
│       /// The value: either VND amount or percentage (0-100)                 │
│       pub amount: Decimal,                                                   │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│   // Hourly Rate (giá theo giờ – bậc thang)                                  │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│   /// A single tier in the hourly rate table.                                │
│   ///                                                                        │
│   /// SkyHotel hourly pricing is tiered:                                     │
│   /// - First 2 hours = 100,000 VND                                          │
│   /// - Hour 3 = +50,000                                                     │
│   /// - Hour 4 = +50,000                                                     │
│   /// - Beyond max hours → switch to overnight/daily                         │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]             │
│   pub struct HourlyRateTier {                                                │
│       /// The hour number (1-based). Hour 1 means "first hour".              │
│       pub hour: u32,                                                         │
│       /// Cumulative price up to (and including) this hour, in VND.          │
│       /// Alternatively, can be incremental — see `is_cumulative`.           │
│       pub price: Decimal,                                                    │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   /// Configuration for hourly-rate billing.                                 │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]                 │
│   pub struct HourlyRate {                                                    │
│       /// The tiered pricing table (ordered by hour ascending).              │
│       /// The price in each tier is the TOTAL price if the guest stays up    │
│   to that many hours.                                                        │
│       pub tiers: Vec<HourlyRateTier>,                                        │
│       /// Maximum hours allowed for hourly billing. Beyond this, switch to   │
│   overnight/daily.                                                           │
│       pub max_hours: u32,                                                    │
│       /// If true, `price` in each tier is cumulative total. If false,       │
│   it's incremental per hour.                                                 │
│       #[serde(default = "default_true")]                                     │
│       pub is_cumulative: bool,                                               │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   fn default_true() -> bool {                                                │
│       true                                                                   │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│   // Overnight Rate (giá qua đêm)                                            │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│   /// Configuration for overnight-rate billing.                              │
│   ///                                                                        │
│   /// Overnight = guest checks in within the overnight window (e.g.,         │
│   21:00) and                                                                 │
│   /// checks out before the checkout deadline (e.g., 12:00 next day).        │
│   #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]             │
│   pub struct OvernightRate {                                                 │
│       /// Base price for one overnight stay (VND)                            │
│       pub base_price: Decimal,                                               │
│       /// Earliest check-in time for overnight rate (e.g., 21:00)            │
│       pub checkin_start: NaiveTime,                                          │
│       /// Latest checkout time (e.g., 12:00 next day — represented as time   │
│   only)                                                                      │
│       pub checkout_deadline: NaiveTime,                                      │
│       /// Surcharge steps for late checkout (quá giờ trả phòng qua đêm)      │
│       #[serde(default)]                                                      │
│       pub late_checkout_steps: Vec<SurchargeStep>,                           │
│       /// Surcharge steps for early check-in (vào trước giờ qua đêm)         │
│       #[serde(default)]                                                      │
│       pub early_checkin_steps: Vec<SurchargeStep>,                           │
│   }                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   //                                                                         │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │
│   ─────                                                                      │
